SUMMARY:Entrepreneurship Roundtable with OPEN
DTSTAMP:20260810T100229Z
DTSTART:20260824T110000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://form.jotform.com/253065225589059 \nThis 
	event will be a facilitated discussion bringing together founders\, builde
	rs\, and innovators to explore what it takes to create\, scale\, and susta
	in meaningful ventures. Every roundtable will have different topics of dis
	cussion as well. Here is the following criteria for individuals to join: \
	n1. Emerging Founders \n– Actively developing a startup\, product\, or bus
	iness concept\n– May be pre-revenue or early revenue (<$500K ARR)\nCommitt
	ed to launching or validating their idea within the next 12 months \n2. Es
	tablished Entrepreneurs \n– Have founded or co-founded a company (past or 
	present)\n– Are seeking to scale\, pivot\, or build their “next best thing
	”\n– Have raised funding\, bootstrapped\, or achieved meaningful revenue m
	ilestones \n3. Intrapreneurs & Innovators \n– Corporate or technical profe
	ssionals building new initiatives\, divisions\, or technologies within the
	ir organizations\n– Interested in transitioning to entrepreneurship or inv
	esting in early-stage ventures \nThose who are selected will be sent a lin
	k to purchase their optional lunch ticket for $20. The cost is to cover th
	e food. If you opt out of lunch\, the event is free.\n\nhttps://iondistric
	t.com/event/entrepreneurship-roundtable-with-open-4/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/entrepreneurship-roundtable-with-open-4/
